units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic

lattice fcc 1.0
region box block 0 1 0 1 0 1 units lattice
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10

mass 1 58.6934

pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/publication/potentials/prompt2.potential Ni

neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes

velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian

timestep 0.001

fix 1 all npt temp 300.0 2500.0 1.0 iso 1.01325 1.01325 10.0

thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step temp press pe ke etotal

run 10

unfix 1